IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-art-8`

-- Tests of P2-art-8.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the quoted line above each function), never from the code's output.
-- Argument order of a gated function: the date asked, the AI system, the harmonisation facts, then the facts of the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`Art 8 test the Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 8 test the Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 8 test the system placed earlier` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 8 test the system placed earlier and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE
`Art 8 test the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 8 test Section B products facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS TRUE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 8 test Section A equivalent facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS TRUE
`Art 8 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE


§ `Article 8(1)`

-- Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section. Args: date asked, system, harmonisation facts, the answers of Articles 9 to 15, taken into account.
-- all seven Articles met, the intended purpose and the state of the art taken into account: complies
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- one Article not met (Article 10): the text says the system shall comply with the requirements: no
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- one met, one not applicable on the date asked (NOTHING), none unmet: not covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, NOTHING, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- one unmet and one not answered: still no (one requirement unmet is enough)
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST NOTHING, JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no answers at all: not covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (EMPTY) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every requirement met but the intended purpose and the state of the art not taken into account
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system, and the day they apply
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Article 2(2): an Article 6(1) system related to Section B products meets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test Section B products facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Article 2(13) does not name Article 8: Section A equivalent protection does not limit it
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test Section A equivalent facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Article 111(2): a system placed earlier and not significantly changed is saved; changed, it is covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) first sentence the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements laid down in this Section` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(2): an Article 6(1) system related to Section B products meets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test Section B products facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 2(2) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system related to Section B products is not cut off
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test Section B products facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13) names Articles 9 to 15 and 17 to 25, not this Article: nothing limits it
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the risk management system referred to in Article 9 has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with those requirements
#ASSERT `Art 8(1) second sentence the risk management system has been taken into account when ensuring compliance with the requirements` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Article 8(2): products that contain an AI system`

-- Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the provider has ensured that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under applicable Union harmonisation legislation
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- outside the scope of the text: the product contains an AI system, to which the requirements of this Regulation as well as requirements of the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I apply is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) first sentence the provider is responsible for ensuring that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under Union harmonisation legislation` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Art 8(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the product is fully compliant (a regulative rule: MUST, no time limit, no consequence: no breach path)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 8(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the product is fully compliant` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 8(2) ensure that the product is fully compliant with all applicable requirements under applicable Union harmonisation legislation` AT 40
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL (nothing done yet: the duty stays open; a late act would still read FULFILLED, so no trace reaches BREACH)
#TRACE `Art 8(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the product is fully compliant` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- the "where" unmet (the product contains no such AI system): nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 8(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the product is fully compliant` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- the Section does not yet apply (the day before): nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 8(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the product is fully compliant` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

