#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
