-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 8 test the Annex I system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 8 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
