#ASSERT `Art 8(2) second sentence the provider has the choice of integrating the necessary testing and reporting processes, information and documentation into existing documentation and procedures` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 8 test the Annex III system` `Art 8 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
